  "details": "VRChat has a lot of bugs now and it has probably been reported but, i'm writing the ones i've seen down in one post:\n\n1. Crouching makes you look up.\n2. Emotes tend to freeze at the end of it.\n3. Sometimes when changing avatar that person might turn invisible and you can't hear that person but you can see nameplate.\n4. You might get randomly teleported home.\n5. When changing avatar you get teleported back and forth (from other people's view)\n6. Video players don't play many of the links you try.\n7. Voice hangs a few secodns after you talk (you can see the icon)\n8. You still can't warn people in worlds as a master but you can de-rank them if it's used a LOT.\n9. When you join a world, your nameplate and loading bar is at or below the ground.",
